trace.request:
Neurological examination:  
- Assess bradykinesia by timing 10 rapid alternating hand movements (e.g., finger-to-thumb taps) on the left vs. right hand;  
- Evaluate for rigidity by passively rotating the left wrist and elbow while the patient is relaxed, checking for increased resistance (cogwheel or lead-pipe).

