trace.request:
Neurological examination:  
- Observe amplitude and speed decrement during 10 consecutive full hand openings and closings with the left hand (patient seated, arm supported, eyes open);  
- Compare to right hand; document presence/absence of progressive reduction in amplitude (i.e., “fatiguing” or “fading” motion).

